==Faroese==
===Etymology===
Old Norse ''[[drepa#Old Norse|drepa]]''

===Verb===
'''drepa'''

# to [[kill]]
# to [[capture]] (''e.g. in chess'')
# to [[dip]]
# to [[move]]
# to get [[wet]]
# to [[drop]]


